NOTE ON THE ARTWORK

The MIT licence above covers the source code. It does not, and cannot, grant
rights over the generated illustrations in `assets/`: those were produced with
Midjourney and with Google Gemini image models, and each carries the terms of
the service that produced it. See the "Where the art comes from" section of
README.md. If you fork this project, replace the artwork or check those terms
for yourself.
